    "detailed_description": "Oh no, you got hit by a truck and died.<br>Fortunately you have been reincarnated as a dungeon core!<br>All you know is what's inside your dungeon domain.<br>All you want is to grow stronger and expand your dungeon.<br><br>A Dungeon Is You is a modern incremental management game.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>Lure raiders into your dungeon with Loot<br>Upgrade your core, it is your last line of defense<br>Gather Knowledge to unlock new features<br>Discover and summon minions to defend you dungeon and upgrade them<br>Place your individual minions freely inside your dungeon<br>Create new dungeon floors<br>(WIP) Refine your mana and unlock new skills<br>(WIP) Send your minions on expeditions to bring back powerful idols or new items to research<br>(WIP) Modify your core with idols and create powerful effect",
    "about_the_game": "Oh no, you got hit by a truck and died.<br>Fortunately you have been reincarnated as a dungeon core!<br>All you know is what's inside your dungeon domain.<br>All you want is to grow stronger and expand your dungeon.<br><br>A Dungeon Is You is a modern incremental management game.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>Lure raiders into your dungeon with Loot<br>Upgrade your core, it is your last line of defense<br>Gather Knowledge to unlock new features<br>Discover and summon minions to defend you dungeon and upgrade them<br>Place your individual minions freely inside your dungeon<br>Create new dungeon floors<br>(WIP) Refine your mana and unlock new skills<br>(WIP) Send your minions on expeditions to bring back powerful idols or new items to research<br>(WIP) Modify your core with idols and create powerful effect",
    "short_description": "You died and got reincarnated as a dungeon core! Grow your dungeon, summon minions to defend you and conquer the world. A Dungeon Is You is a modern incremental dungeon management game. With a sprinkle of tower defense and rpg.",
